|term[progressive-routing] :status settled :defined-by def-locations-and-paths :anchor progressive-routing
  :word progressive-routing
  Per-hop ownership of resolution: each intermediate location routes only its next hop.
  |invariants
    - Performed by exactly one [[term/resolution-engine]] as the composite of per-hop owners
    - Re-binding one intermediate re-routes every path through it
    - A default at an intermediate is a routing choice, not an accident
